From 8636a3004a0d63f491597db61c4d3b6ee41c64e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 20:59:08 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Add Caddy status monitor and merge Caddy API settings into
 Caddy Servers

Per-server admin API port, optional VIP admin API URL for two-server setups,
and a background /config/ status check alongside the ping monitor. Navbar
tags combine both (green/yellow/red); Dashboard stats come from the VIP URL,
else a server with Caddy running. Old Caddy admin API URL migrates to the VIP URL.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GFYvS9x1oJ8BCyJk4RqsZW
